{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, בְּטֵל","hw":"בְּטֵל","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">בְּטֵל</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. cease (</strong>late BH<strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Pe.</strong>  Pf. 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּטִלַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:24\" href=\"/Ezra.4.24\">Ezr 4:24</a>, Pt. fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּֽטְלָא</span> v <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:24\" href=\"/Ezra.4.24\">24</a> (both of work).<br><strong>Pa.</strong>  <em>make to cease</em>, acc. pers.: Pf. 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּטִּ֫לוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:23\" href=\"/Ezra.4.23\">4:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:5\" href=\"/Ezra.5.5\">5:5</a>; Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְבַטָּלָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:21\" href=\"/Ezra.4.21\">4:21</a>, acc. pers. om. <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:8\" href=\"/Ezra.6.8\">6:8</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, בֵּין","prev":"BDB Aramaic, בָּל"}